{
    "background_story": "Alaya was a brilliant cartographer who spent her life studying the ancient maps of a long-lost civilization. She became obsessed with finding the fabled city of Zerzura, hidden deep within the desert. After years of research, Alaya finally pinpointed the location, and thereto she set out on an expedition to uncover the ruins. Braving treacherous sandstorms and treacherous terrain, she led her team through the unforgiving landscape. As they reached the site, Alaya's heart swelled with excitement - the maps had been correct, and the city lay before them, waiting to be unearthed. Her discovery sparked a new era of archaeological exploration, and Alaya's name became synonymous with bravery and scholarly excellence. Thereto, she continued to explore the secrets of Zerzura, unraveling the mysteries of a bygone era.",
